# Polylang PHP

Text domain: `polylang`. New modules, integrations, and test classes use `WP_Syntex\Polylang\…`. A new class in an existing `PLL_*` tree stays `PLL_*`.

```php
namespace WP_Syntex\Polylang\Switcher\Settings;
```

Layout and Rector: `.cursor/reference/php-conventions.md`.
